WEBVTT

00:06:59.292 --> 00:07:03.601
Frankly, he didn't send his supporters
out into the streets

00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:04.934
with protest signs

00:07:04.958 --> 00:07:07.101
or pitchforks or long guns.

00:07:07.125 --> 00:07:10.143
As soon as the court said
the vote count is done,

00:07:10.167 --> 00:07:13.726
he just conceded to George W. Bush.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.976
Because that's what we do,

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.309
that's just kind of how
we do things around here.

00:07:18.333 --> 00:07:20.309
You don't fight in the extra innings.

00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:23.143
Until maybe 2020,

00:07:23.167 --> 00:07:25.476
when one major candidate is already saying

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.268
he may not accept the results
of the vote counting.

00:07:29.292 --> 00:07:31.101
Curse you 2020.